= Notes
Intended for players who are potentially new to ttrpgs \
No vehicle - smaller scale \
More railroady - the players are being paid to go do a thing \
Character creation optional \
Wandering merchant encounter \
Forest \
Big tree \
Big lake \
Waterfall with treasure behind it \
Ruins \
Trails \
Small area, still has variety \
Players are given an undetailed map with landmarks like waterways and locations of interest \
Hunt a beast in a region of a few hexes
- Beast 
  - Grounded (no climbing/flying)
- Merchant 
- Locations 
- Environments 
  - Navigate 
  - Forage 
  - Hunt 
  - Environment Actions
  - Creature table 
- Bestiary
  - Attributes 
  - Weapons 
  - Hit thresholds 
  - Abilities 
  - Speed 
  - AP 
  - Drops
Potential express by boat from the lake to the hunting grounds \

